  "Record paid and credit sales, keep a clear transaction history, and see daily sales totals with DukaSmart shop sales software.": "Rekodi mauzo yaliyolipwa na ya mkopo, hifadhi historia ya miamala, na angalia jumla ya mauzo ya kila siku kwa mfumo wa mauzo wa DukaSmart.",
