  "Restocking affects both cash and the amount of stock available to sell. Keeping each delivery's quantities and costs together gives a shop owner a clearer history of what came in and what it cost.": "Kujaza stoku huathiri fedha na bidhaa zinazopatikana kuuzwa. Kuweka idadi na gharama za kila mzigo pamoja humpa mmiliki historia iliyo wazi ya kilichopokelewa na gharama yake.",
